    "description": {
      "value": "<p>After spending a Long Rest in your Bastion, you gain a magical Charm (see @UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.content.JournalEntry.dmgDmsToolbox000.JournalEntryPage.U9qU1oUFTPAK7g50]{Supernatural Gifts}) that lasts for 7 days or until you use it. The Charm allows you to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplHeal000000]{Heal}<em> </em>once without expending a spell slot. You can’t gain this Charm again while you still have it.</p>",
